{
 "id": 1803236,
 "titulo": "12/13 Update Details",
 "fecha": 1702450817760,
 "modificada": 1766090119516,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1803236",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1699334452466\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/99260c8b1c134f72bdf1d5887953be6e_1699334452466_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">An unfolding story with the theme of What If..?<br>\nhas gathered heroes living different lives within the alternative stories.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We introduce the December Update&nbsp;<br>\nin celebration of the release of Marvel Studios’ <em>What If..? Season 2</em>.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Hela</span>, who rules the realm of death in Asgard, has become stronger with <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-4 Advancement</span>,<br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Wenwu</span>, the experienced master of the Ten Rings, has gained the powers of <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-3</span>,<br>\nand along with the new Mohawk hero, <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Kahhori</span>, who has gained power through the Tesseract,<br>\nnew Uniforms have been added for <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Hela</span>, <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Wenwu</span>, and <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Nebula</span>.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Various improvements such as the addition of <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">new Comic Cards</span> that will enhance heroes’ abilities,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">and a <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Story Fragment conversion</span> system,&nbsp;<br>\nwhere Story Fragments can be used more efficiently have been made, so don’t miss out!</span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ One New Hero</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the abilities of Kahorri &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ What If…?</em>&gt;,<br>\nwho has come from one of the Native American tribes, the Mohawk,<br>\nand has gained powers from the Space Stone.&nbsp;<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The hero skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371200232\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/98abea2af6d54cf88bc054f17a961154_1702371200232_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Three New Uniforms</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Three new Uniforms have been added<br>\nin celebration of the release of Marvel Studios’ <em>What If…? Season 2</em>.<br>\nCheck out the abilities of Hela &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ What If…?</em>&gt;,&nbsp;<br>\nWenwu &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ What If…?</em>&gt;, and Super Nova Nebula &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ What If…?</em>&gt;.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* New Uniform Skills are based on the following skill Level stats. (Tier-4 heroes: Lv. 10, Others: Lv. 6)<br>\n* The three new Uniforms will be&nbsp;on sale for </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">40% off during the &lt;December Update Celebration Event&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">,<br>\nand can be checked and purchased in the Marvel Universe and Uniform Room after the event.&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371269942\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/1c8bc96ed2784c949e8bb4b8c981925a_1702371269942_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371278392\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/93137c25df4f4e1da1215565a3b4987b_1702371278392_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371287821\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b08d81af98574968ad9310aeb3bbb8c4_1702371287821_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Hela Tier-4</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Tier-4 Advancement has been added to Hela.&nbsp;<br>\nCheck out her abilities that can control death.&nbsp;<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371319166\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/dd12432e36c643b0b25bdc7e1ae3ee04_1702371319166_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Wenwu Tier-3</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Wenwu, the leader of the Ten Rings with a formidable presence hidden in the shadows,&nbsp;<br>\nhas received Tier-3 Advancement.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702438809162\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/494858c47e0a4e2c9a29a2ef9cc367db_1702438809162_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371358599\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/111723351ba94a90866e86f92a6df094_1702371358599.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Kahhori, Katy, and Lincoln Campbell&nbsp;Potential Awakening &amp; Transcendence</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Through the December Update, Kahorri, Katy, and Lincoln Campbell<br>\nwill&nbsp;acquire Potential Awakening &amp; Transcendence!<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371392088\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/bee38db659af432d866d8e9f3cb09985_1702371392088_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371416878\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/b97aff24b3974bbda5591a2cfa6cf985_1702371416878.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371428577\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/acb2afe120ca49e48ea71c9c3f44cae6_1702371428577.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371433130\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/310e5ad56ec249cb9f67d2ee887bf7b0_1702371433130.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Comic Cards and Collection</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Five new Comic Cards with the theme of &lt;What If?&gt; have been added.&nbsp;<br>\nCollect these Comic Cards with powerful options and upgrade all of them to Mythic<br>\nto acquire the MAX HP increases by 4% effect as a collection reward.&nbsp;<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The following Comic Cards can be acquired at the&nbsp;<br>\nStore - Dimension Chest - Comic Card Chest after the December Update maintenance.<br>\n* The [What If? Ghost Rider (2018) #1] cannot be acquired from the<br>\nPremium Comic Card Chest that can be purchased with Premium Comic Card Exchange Tokens.&nbsp;<br>\n* The effects are based on the highest quality and rank.</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702456108972\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/e198dc784ad84a7fbc2d2919179a3e2e_1702456108972_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371496244\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b13d9eb66e85427e8e368b2aae9bbd77_1702371496244_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371506170\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/3df6f6166261402c96f14d6dff70e0ce_1702371506170_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371511476\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/6f7da2249bcb4f32b9c82ee039662945_1702371511476_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371515745\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/80b1603145d4495292e2d56c5b4414a9_1702371515745_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Artifacts</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Exclusive Passive Skill Artifacts for Kahhori, Wenwu, Katy,&nbsp;<br>\nand Lincoln Campbell will be added after the December Update.&nbsp;<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371539103\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/72016de5cd114a8c92ee1620af7c723e_1702371539103_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Future Pass Season &amp; Special Icons</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A new season of Future Pass will begin after the update.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>[Future Pass Rewards]</strong></span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702372163286\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/7a4424f32da84ca28452e70214b94c2d_1702372163286_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Please note that the Future Pass effects will apply immediately upon purchase and cannot be refunded.<br>\n- Legendary / Mythic Future Pass that has been unlocked will only be applied during the season the Pass was purchased, and the Pass rewards will only be available during the same season. Please don’t forget to check the remaining event time.<br>\n- The Mythic Pass can be purchased after purchasing the Legendary Pass.<br>\n- Legendary and Mythic Future Passes will not be available for purchase&nbsp;<br>\nwhen the season is about to end. Please check the sale schedule in the game.</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\nNew Special Icons that will represent you have been added.<br>\nCollect two new Icons as Future Pass Rewards,&nbsp;<br>\none as an Event Token Archive reward, and one more from the upcoming Event!</span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>[December Update New Special Icon]</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371610912\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/dd580bc3fcc94c439314c6a34a5fb9a3_1702371610912.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371615573\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/96ccdca541dd4bea8104cdd9cb3ae650_1702371615573.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371637527\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/e297cca9aa294b0fb98fc1689678f154_1702371637527.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371715282\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/05b6277bc03645cb8a14aa5bcbf0786b_1702371715282.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ New Uniform Collection</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the new Uniforms of the Marvel Studios’ <em>What If…? </em>theme.<br>\nComplete the collection by achieving the specified conditions and earn a reward.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371750301\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/598c1b7c26464db8b415029f99ba58a7_1702371750301_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Other Improvements and Changes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The equipping of Tier-4 Striker Skills has been improved.&nbsp;<br>\n▶ If a Striker is set on a different Tier-4 hero, the Striker list will display the 'In Use' text.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">When selected, the Striker for the other Tier-4 hero will be deactivated&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">and immediately set as the Striker&nbsp;of the current Tier-4 hero.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371771769\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/ec7ba5e1914748e782a2b1f441bc06a4_1702371771769_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371779592\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/0c668b2e66af45ea89eb977791d34f5f_1702371779592_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ If a Tier-4 hero without a Striker equipped is included in the team<br>\nat the battle preparation screen, a warning pop-up screen will now be displayed when starting a battle.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371793921\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/6d85b1de95cf4482a982e057218e720d_1702371793921_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. An option to consecutively upgrade a Custom Gear to the max grade has been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">When upgrading Custom Gear after checking the Quick Upgrade option&nbsp;<br>\nat the Inventory or Custom Gear of the according hero,<br>\nyou can decide whether to upgrade to the max grade consecutively and</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">whether to use upgraded Gear as materials.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371808874\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/e1fda2dfc85a463cbe4cdbe8647d58b3_1702371808874_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. A new Convert Fragments menu in the Story Fragment combination system has been added.&nbsp;<br>\nAgents can now use [Normal Conversion],&nbsp;<br>\nwhere fragments of the same theme can be acquired at an equal probability,&nbsp;<br>\nand [Guaranteed Conversion], where selected fragments can be guaranteed for acquisition.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Only fragments of the same theme can be acquired when converting Story Fragments.<br>\n- Guaranteed Conversion will require more materials than Normal Conversion.</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371863266\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/cea99ae19feb425f9fd2d1d06c43fa81_1702371863266_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371869550\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/5ee39e13a2e349038980499dfe4b98fa_1702371869550_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371875066\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/bc2e84de4fe74e8bbf7518e7c1b23ba9_1702371875066_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. A [Menu] - [Settings] - [Option] - [Show Event Notifications] setting function has been added.&nbsp;<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Applied game modes: Timeline Survival, Cosmic Core Event, Future Pass, and Faction Battle</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371896287\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b49cff69a1cc481aa51608ae62a18973_1702371896287_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">5. The filter option at the Alliance Battle team selection screen has been improved.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Leader filter: a feature that filters Leader type heroes with the applicable&nbsp;<br>\nLeader skill for the participating heroes has been added.<br>\n- Support filter: a feature that filters Support type heroes with the applicable&nbsp;<br>\nPassive skill, Tier-2 skill, and Uniform effect for the participating heroes has been added.&nbsp;<br>\n- Dealer filter: a feature that filters Dealer type heroes with the applicable&nbsp;<br>\nLeader, Passive, Tier-2, and Uniform effect of the participating heroes has been added.&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371922038\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/993aa46eeaa84fe9a84a980ab54ca2d4_1702371922038_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">6. Certain parts of the Team-Up Collection have been improved.&nbsp;<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- When possessing more tokens than the cost required for collection upgrade,<br>\na notification badge will be displayed.<br>\n- A ‘Shop’ button has been added at the Team-Up Collection screen&nbsp;<br>\nto check recommended products for each theme.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">7. The patterns of Surtur in Alliance Battle &lt;Legend Mode&gt; have been improved.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- An animation sequence has been added before Surtur begins the dash attack<br>\n- Surtur’s dash attack has been patternized</span>.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">8. The Special Boost hero warning pop-up screen has been improved to not be displayed<br>\nuntil reset even after selecting [Don’t Show Again] and tapping the Cancel button.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">9. The other button flickering when setting the count to [Min] or [Max]&nbsp;<br>\nat the “Auto Repeat” popup screen has been improved.&nbsp;</span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Game Error Fixes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. A dialogue being displayed when failing the&nbsp;<br>\nLegendary Battle: <em>Marvel Studios’ The Marvels</em> Chapter 2 Mission has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. The Weekly requirements&nbsp;of the Training Mode not matching&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">with the actual Alliance Battle requirements have&nbsp;been fixed.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">3. Certain conditions of the Captain Marvel Artifact Exclusive Passive skill effect&nbsp;<br>\nbeing incorrectly applied due to the Captain Marvel Tier-2 Passive Skill option&nbsp;<br>\n‘Increases ALL BUFFS effect.’ has been fixed.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">4. &nbsp;Certain skills of stage boss, Human Torch, being incorrectly displayed in&nbsp;<br>\nEpic Quest &lt;First Family&gt;: Like Brothers – Hothead Stages #1 - #4 has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">5. Otherworld Battle matching outside of the matching screen</span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">when immediately canceling the match&nbsp;after tapping the [Start] button&nbsp;<br>\nat the Auto Repeat pop-up screen has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">6. The + button at the Auto Repeat pop-up screen<br>\nnot activating in certain game modes has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We will return with various content improvements, so please stay tuned.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1702371977518\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/f3ec8b6f3470485ca15bc141899cf4a3_1702371977518_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n"
}